{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Airfleet - your own airline is in your hands! Manage every aspect of the business: from thoughtful route planning to precise crew selection, every decision affects the reputation and efficiency of the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/Routes_En.png?t=1742995123\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/gif3.gif?t=1742995123\" />Create an extensive transportation network, combining major international terminals with cozy provincial airfields. Optimize connections and logistics, turning each airport into a vital hub for your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/Passengers_En.png?t=1742995123\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/gif2.gif?t=1742995123\" />Choose your strategy: become a leader in mass budget transportation or create an elite service for demanding customers. A variety of classes allows you to customize comfort and pricing, gaining passenger trust and loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/Fleet_En.png?t=1742995123\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/gif1.gif?t=1742995123\" />Build a unique fleet of more than 11 detailed recreations of civilian vehicles from around the world. Transport passengers on modern airliners, regional jets and fuel-efficient turboprops to meet every demand.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/Theme_En.png?t=1742995123\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/gif4.gif?t=1742995123\" />Use the color theme customization to make the look of the game pleasing to you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1421380?t=1742995123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/b68b4f77c48624bdcfcb91c0fc2ad34618f20e9f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742995123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/5992b885e4d49226acccb453148ebf3f8534051a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742995123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/5992b885e4d49226acccb453148ebf3f8534051a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742995123","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Add to your wish list!</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/Steam_wishlist_GIF.gif?t=1742995123\" /></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Airfleet - your own airline is in your hands! Manage every aspect of the business: from thoughtful route planning to precise crew selection, every decision affects the reputation and efficiency of the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/Routes_En.png?t=1742995123\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/gif3.gif?t=1742995123\" />Create an extensive transportation network, combining major international terminals with cozy provincial airfields. Optimize connections and logistics, turning each airport into a vital hub for your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/Passengers_En.png?t=1742995123\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/gif2.gif?t=1742995123\" />Choose your strategy: become a leader in mass budget transportation or create an elite service for demanding customers. A variety of classes allows you to customize comfort and pricing, gaining passenger trust and loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/Fleet_En.png?t=1742995123\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/gif1.gif?t=1742995123\" />Build a unique fleet of more than 11 detailed recreations of civilian vehicles from around the world. Transport passengers on modern airliners, regional jets and fuel-efficient turboprops to meet every demand.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/Theme_En.png?t=1742995123\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/extras/gif4.gif?t=1742995123\" />Use the color theme customization to make the look of the game pleasing to you!</p>","developers":["River Way Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421380/eb21920b27d47a13fee22ccc78bf770290e81ad9/header.jpg?t=1742995123","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257114102,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114102/movie480.mp4